    <item>
      <title>City Building</title>
      <link>//localhost:1315/projects/city_building/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 05 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>//localhost:1315/projects/city_building/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;city-building&#34;&gt;City Building&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A work-in-progress UE5.3 city-building prototype, recreating &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLFYGCCDpMHmHJwhIRY6qNumAts--W8bTy&#34;&gt;The Game Dev Channel&amp;rsquo;s City Building series&lt;/a&gt; in C++ instead of Blueprints. Features a grid-based placement system for roads and buildings with adjacency validation and preview materials, a day/night cycle with adjustable time speed, a currency system, and randomized citizen generation (mesh, gender, name, age, education, health).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/RqDowQ9bURY&#34;&gt;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://img.youtube.com/vi/RqDowQ9bURY/hqdefault.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Watch the video&#34;  /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/AhmedYAbbas/UE5.3-City-Builder&#34;&gt;GitHub →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Thor</title>
      <link>//localhost:1315/projects/thor/</link>
