      <guid>//localhost:1315/projects/thor/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;thor&#34;&gt;Thor&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A third-person Unreal Engine 5.1 prototype recreating Thor&amp;rsquo;s Mjolnir — throw, catch, recall, and ground-slam for an area attack, plus a focus/lock-on system and a Frost Giant enemy to fight against. Built primarily in Blueprints with a lightweight C++ actor class driving the hammer&amp;rsquo;s flight logic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;demo&#34;&gt;Demo&lt;/h2&gt;
